# DUMKA3 (Medovikov 1998): third order stabilized method realized as a composition of
# three-stage substeps. Coefficients transcribed from the reference C code dumka3.c by
# A. A. Medovikov (http://dumkaland.org/dumka3.c); each row is one substep
# (a21, a31, a32, a41, a42, a43) in units of dt. The rows satisfy a41 = a31 and a42 = a32,
# and a31 = a21 in every row except the last of each degree, which perform_step! relies on.
# The reference code also tabulates degree 324 (rows 293:400); it is omitted here because
# those coefficients do not form a consistent method (the substep times do not sum to dt
# and the stability polynomial exceeds one on its interval).

